+The menu (with the forge_ui mod, mods/forge_ui) is drawn large on a dark
+panel, with the categories as tabs, the chosen row marked and the keys
+explained at the bottom. It keeps its place while it is closed: the
+category, and in each category the chosen row (by tag name, so it carries
+over to other maps that have the same tag) and how far the list is
+scrolled. The place lasts for the whole session and is written to
+u:\forge_ui.txt (forge_ui.txt in the directory u/ of the save root,
+~/.local/share/halo-linux/u/) when the menu closes, and read back the first
+time it opens after the game starts. A closed menu does nothing else.
+
